{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar 11.6.17 — business / wholesale quote page.

  Hero, four benefit cards and a quote request form. The form is Shopify's
  native contact form, so submissions arrive as e-mail at the store's contact
  address with no app and no third-party data processing. Custom fields are
  passed as contact[Label] and appear as labelled lines in that e-mail.

  Copy is localised NL/EN/DE/FR in the section. The product list in the
  dropdown is read from the catalogue, so it stays current by itself.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
